<item><title>Burkina Faso vows support for gold miners expelled from Guinea</title><link>https://africanstreetjournal.com/bf/burkina-faso-vows-support-for-gold-miners-expelled-from-810564/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://africanstreetjournal.com/bf/burkina-faso-vows-support-for-gold-miners-expelled-from-810564/</guid><category>Burkina Faso</category><description>Thousands of Burkinabe miners expelled from Guinea for illegal gold mining are arriving home, with the government promising education, training and reintegration help.</description><pubDate>Fri, 13 Nov 2026 19:10:40 GMT</pubDate><enclosure url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/bf/burkina-faso-vows-support-for-gold-miners-expelled-from-810564/share.jpg" length="41949" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/bf/burkina-faso-vows-support-for-gold-miners-expelled-from-810564/share.jpg" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1200" height="630"/></item>
